  "comments": {},
  "notes": "- Could we simplify spell-ui by e.g. not depending on CSS for all attribute changes, but maybe writing simple things as style properties on elements?  Feels like the CSS-based SemanticUI scheme is holding us back/forcing to make things more complicated than they should be."
}
